@format 1
@id tabs.add
@title Add tab
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Create one tab of the selected layout type, insert it into the tab set, and select it.
@section I. UI
@tabs Global interface
@flow TB
@related tabs.select, tabs.close

@alias toolbar = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.PToolbar
@alias tabset = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.LTabset

[input] Tab type selected <input>
- Receive a tab-layout choice from the add menu @ toolbar.PTabLayoutAdd(...)
> create

[create] Create typed tab <process>
- Create the selected workspace and tab record with a unique title @ tabset.LTabsetAdd(...)
- Insert the record and refresh ordinal titles and separators @ tabset.LTabsetTypedAdd(...)
> select

[select] Select new tab <output>
- Make the new tab current @ tabset.LTabsetSelect(...)
= The selected tab surface is visible and included in session state.
